<p>
  Artifact is a non-profit that supports design-focused open source software and
  tools, built by a community of creators. Its work is shared infrastructure:
  hosting, tools, and technical advisory for the people making things. You can
  help with your time or with a gift — both matter, and time is often the
  scarcer of the two.
</p>

<h2>Give time</h2>

<p>
  Everything Artifact releases is open source, so the most useful contribution
  is usually to pick up something real. Start with the code or come say hello
  first — either is a fine way in.
</p>

<ul>
  <li><a href="https://github.com/arfct">GitHub</a> — the projects themselves, and their open issues</li>
  <li><a href="https://discord.com/invite/fmvwuvjJ8Y">Discord</a> — where the community talks</li>
</ul>

